# ATR backend URL (FastAPI).
#
# Leave this UNSET for `atr serve` — the SPA is served by the same FastAPI
# process on the same port, so a relative URL is always correct and works on
# any port. Setting it to :8000 makes `atr serve --port <other>` unreachable.
#
# Set it only for `atr dev`, where Vite runs on :5173 and FastAPI on :8000:
#   VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
